3>\n <br>\n <div id="buttonTiktokLogin"></div>\n <div id="buttonTiktokLogout"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div>\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="setup-import-export-settings">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Import/Export Settings</h3>\n Here you can export your current profile settings to a file in order to share it<br>\n with other users or to import it into a different profile.\n <br><br>\n <div id="settingsExportButton"></div>\n <div id="settingsImportButton"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n \x3c!-- <div>\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Reset Settings</h3>\n Here you can reset (delete) your TikFinity settings of the current profile.\n <br><br>\n <div id="buttonResetSettings"></div>\n <div id="buttonResetImportedSettings"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n </div> --\x3e\n\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="setup-advanced-settings">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Advanced Settings</h3>\n\n <div id="checkboxServerSideConnection"></div>\n <div id="checkboxShowTiktokPopup"></div>\n <div id="checkboxShowLocalizedGiftNames"></div>\n <div id="checkboxShowUserNicknames"></div>\n <div id="checkboxProcessOnlyFirstEmoteByActions"></div>\n <div id="checkboxQueueKeystrokes"></div>\n <br>\n\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n  <div class="dx-fieldset">\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  TikTok Language\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxWebcastLanguage"></div>\n  <small>Relevant for localized gifts. Requires a valid language-country code. Example: en-US</small>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class="showOnlyElectron">\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">API Connectivity</h3>\n\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <div>\n  If the connection to the TikFinity server is unstable and you receive<br>\n  a large number of API errors, you can switch to an alternative server.<br>\n  This creates an entry in your system\'s hosts file.\n  </div>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <div id="buttonSwitchServer"></div>\n  <div id="buttonRestoreServer"></div>\n\n  <br>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="setup-debug-options">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Debug Options</h3>\n\n <table>\n <tr>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <div>\n  This function is used to identify errors.<br>\n  Activate it when prompted by the TikFinity Support Team!\n  </div>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <div id="buttonEnableDebug"></div>\n  <div id="buttonOpenTikTok"></div>\n\n  <br>\n  </td>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <pre id="browserBridgeDebug" style="margin-top: -30px; margin-left: 100px;"></pre>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n\n</div>\n<br><br><br>\n\n<div id="setupConditionalDbResetPopup"></div>'},{name:"chatbot",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<div class="desktopAppPromotion"></div>\n\n<h2 class="blueheading" data-str="chatbot_head"></h2>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div id="notificationChatbotNeedsApproval" class="hidden">\n <div id="chatbotNoticeBanners">\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 900px; background-color: #570d1c;" data-str="chatbot_requirements"></div>\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 900px; background-color: #570d1c;" data-str="chatbot_replacement"></div>\n <br>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id="chatbotWarning">\n <br>\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 650px; background-color: #570d1c;">Please keep in mind that your account is used to send chatbot messages. Make sure that all messages comply wi