ast took an action such as Follow or Subscribe.<br>\n To include the overlays in <b>OBS (Browser Source)</b> or <b>LIVE Studio (Link)</b>, simply copy the URLs.<br>\n You can change the font and color or hide the profile pictures by clicking on the "Customize" button.\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div id="lastXOverlayList"></div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionOverlayFix" id="lastx-settings">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Settings</h3>\n\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div class="dx-fieldset">\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">Refresh Interval (seconds)</div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="numberboxLastXRefreshInterval"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">Fade Duration (milliseconds)</div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="numberboxLastXFadeDuration"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<br><br>'},{name:"halving",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<h2 class="blueheading" data-str="halving_head"></h2>\n<div data-str="halving_desc"></div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth">\n <div>\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div class="dx-fieldset">\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label" data-str="halving_percent"></div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxHalvingPercent"></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class="dx-fieldset">\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label" data-str="halving_example_before"></div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value dxFieldValueFix" id="halvingExampleBefore">0</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label" data-str="halving_example_after"></div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value dxFieldValueFix" id="halvingExampleAfter">0</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label" data-str="halving_last_execute"></div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value dxFieldValueFix" id="halvingLastExecution">-</div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class="dx-fieldset">\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label"></div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="buttonExecuteHalving"></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>'},{name:"rtmpgen",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<h2 class="blueheading">Stream Key Generator</h2>\n\n<div>\n Retrieves an <a href="https://obsproject.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OBS</a> compatible Stream Key from TikTok Live Studio.<br>\n This feature is experimental!\n</div>\n<br><br>\n\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Connect Info</h3>\n <div style="width: 650px; text-align: center;">\n <div class="dxForm streamKeyForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div class="dx-fieldset">\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">Server</div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxRtmpgenHost"></div>\n  <dib id="buttonRtmpgenCopyHost"></dib>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">Stream Key</div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxRtmpgenKey"></div>\n  <dib id="buttonRtmpgenCopyKey"></dib>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <br>\n <div id="rtmpgenKeyKeyButton"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth">\n <div style="width: 650px;">\n <b>Requirements</b>\n <ul>\n <li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/studio/download" target="_blank">TikTok Live Studio</a> must be installed on this computer.</li>\n <li>Your TokTok Account needs access to streaming via TikTok Live Studio.</li>\n </ul>\n <b>Instructions</b>\n <ol>\n <li>Start your stream in Live Studio (Landscape or Portrait mode).</li>\n <li>Configure OBS to use the same resolution, bitrate and FPS.</li>\n <li>Click the <b>Generate Key</b> button and confirm all prompts.</li>\n <li>Copy the Server and Stream Key to OBS (Settings > Stream > Service: Custom)</li>\n <li>Start streaming from OBS.</li>\n </ol>\n <b>Good to know</b>\n <ul>\n <li>Live Studio Compatibility mode is not supported when streaming from OBS.</li>\n <li>After key generation you have about 2 minutes to enter the key in OBS and start the stream. Meanwhile, your viewers will see an unstable connection warning.</li>\n <li>The generated Server and Key is only valid for a single stream.</li>\n <li>For a new stream you need to generate new data.</li>\n <li>Never share the key with anyone else!</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n</div>'},{name:"timer",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<div class="desktopAppPromotion"></div>\n\n<h2 class="blueheading">Timer</h2>\n<div>\n Here you can create a countdown that can be controlled by your viewers.<br>\n Viewers can extend or shorten the countdown through interactions to decide how long you have to stream.<br>\n Watch <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=363AX0F6VPY" target="_blank">this tutorial</a> to learn how to set up a subathon timer.<br>\n</div>\n<br>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" id="timer-overlay">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Overlay</h3>\n\n <div class="timerpageoverlays" data-widgetid="timer"></